# Security headers for the static site (Cloudflare Pages).
# The /insights, /track, /oembed Functions set their own headers in code.
# X-Frame-Options is SAMEORIGIN (not DENY) so the homepage can iframe the
# same-origin satmap.html; cross-origin framing is still blocked.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
